[[!:https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/02829fc9750a193799ea05d6e0ab0ef78b0cffa0.png]]((Fairfax Industries Employee Spotlight announcement art))

Today, Fairfax Industries is proud to introduce their most valuable salesman: Deadman Danny. Wielding a rocket launcher and flying high above the streets of New York (courtesy of the __Chimera Mk1__ - the latest and greatest in self-adhered aviation technology), Danny rains his __Strix Salvo__ missiles down upon foes, marking them for future attacks. __Jettison Fuel__ is a handy trick that both expels heat from the Chimera System, while also dousing nearby enemies in the warm embrace of a fiery inferno. Yet his most impressive tactic has always been his ability to __Close the Deal__, wowing prospective customers with an explosive hands-on demonstration of all that Fairfax has to offer. - __"At Fairfax Industries we say "All's Fair", but that's not true! Because with the Fairfax Chimera Mark 1, you have the advantage."__

Take flight with Deadman Danny, available in-game now! With only two hero releases remaining, keep your votes coming to help determine who will be joining us on **Friday October 16th at 2pm PDT.**